# What the `tests` job in .github/workflows/gates.yml asks for, before resolution.
#
# The job installs the COMPILED sibling, `ci-tests.txt`, which names this set plus everything it
# drags in, each with its hashes. This file is the intent; that one is what runs.
#
# Regenerate with, from the repository root:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras --output-file=requirements/ci-tests.txt \
#       requirements/ci-tests.in
#
# NOTHING ELSE BELONGS HERE. `tests/test_door_matches_ci.py` deliberately imports no PyYAML on the
# ground that this job installs pytest and pytest-cov and nothing more; adding a line here quietly
# widens what that file is allowed to assume.
pytest
pytest-cov
